= docs: unit artifact milestone 3 -- plan, ledger, reports, the perf plan
The milestone-3 plan (Rakudo on the unit road: encoder shapes, the flip, two t/ sweeps, the
compiler-side deletions) with Task 3b, the unit-road gaps the t/ sweep found (6 encoder
refusals, 5 engine-correctness causes); the done record (plan position, spec milestones 3/4,
the eval-server sweep numbers, the encoder switches are not opt-outs); the ledger twin synced
through the final review, fix wave and re-review, with the task and final-fix reports; the
performance measurement session plan. watched-run --follow ends on a -t digest too.
